        "title": "Magnificent and divine",
        "text": "The Pashupatinath Temple lives up to its reputation as a sprawling and magnificent Temple dedicated to Pashupatinath (Shiva). As a Hindu, the Temple is sacred to me of course but notwithstanding the religious affinity, this Temple holds significance as the oldest Temple in Kathmandu and its architecture is very distinct and attractive",
